%% SwiftDrop Member 1 - WebSocket / SSE handshake and live update workflow
%% Source of truth: LiveTrackingStreamController, TrackingWebSocketHandler,
%% StompTrackingWebSocketHandler, useTrackingStream.ts, ParcelStatusEventConsumer
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client (browser / mobile)
    participant GW as api-gateway :8080
    participant REDIS as Redis
    participant ORD as customer-order-service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant DEL as delivery-execution-service
    participant IAM as auth-iam-service

    Note over C,GW: Phase 1 - first paint (public snapshot, polling fallback too)
    C->>GW: GET /api/v1/tracking/{id}
    GW->>REDIS: INCR rate:public-track:{ip}:{window}
    alt over the limit
        GW-->>C: 429 Too Many Requests
    else within the limit
        GW->>ORD: GET /internal/v1/orders/tracking/{id}
        ORD-->>GW: status history, city and district
        GW->>GW: sanitise PII, build PublicTrackingViewDto
        GW-->>C: 200 sanitised snapshot
    end

    Note over C,GW: Phase 2 - live stream (SSE first)
    C->>GW: GET /api/v1/tracking/{id}/stream (text/event-stream)
    GW->>ORD: enrich initial snapshot
    GW-->>C: event: initial snapshot
    loop every 15 s
        GW-->>C: comment: heartbeat
    end

    Note over C,DEL: Phase 3 - status event fan-out
    DEL->>MQ: publish ParcelStatusChangedEvent<br/>routing key parcel.status.changed.{status}
    MQ->>GW: queue swiftdrop.gateway.tracking.queue
    GW->>GW: TrackingDataSanitizerProxy + enrichment
    GW-->>C: event: sanitised PublicTrackingViewDto
    alt terminal status DELIVERED or FAILED
        GW-->>C: final event then close the stream
        C->>C: stop reconnect and polling
    end

    Note over C,IAM: Phase 4 - WebSocket and STOMP fallback
    C->>GW: WS /ws/tracking?trackingId={id}<br/>subprotocol stomp or raw JSON
    alt subprotocol contains stomp
        C->>GW: STOMP CONNECT (Authorization: Bearer ...)
        opt private customer topic
            GW->>IAM: GET JWKS when kid is unknown (throttled)
            IAM-->>GW: JWKS document
            GW->>GW: TrackingTokenVerifier checks iss, aud, HS256 or RS256
        end
        C->>GW: SUBSCRIBE /topic/track/{id} or /topic/customer/{customerId}
        GW-->>C: CONNECTED then MESSAGE frames
    else raw JSON stream
        GW-->>C: text frames with sanitised view and ping heartbeats
    end

    Note over C,GW: Phase 5 - reconnect and graceful degradation
    C->>GW: transport fails
    C->>C: exponential backoff 1 s, 2 s, 5 s, 10 s
    alt one SSE failure
        C->>GW: retry SSE after backoff
    else two SSE failures
        C->>GW: switch to WebSocket
    end
    alt two WebSocket failures
        C->>GW: fall back to GET snapshot every 10 s
    end
    C->>C: 404 or 429 is fatal, stop retrying
